  "title": "Procurement policy note 11/15: unstructured electronic invoices",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-1115-unstructured-electronic-invoices",
  "description": "Central government departments and their arm's length bodies must accept unstructured e-invoices submitted on or after 30 June 2015.\r\n",
